  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Sunday Tutoring Group (Free) for k-5+ Students in Charlotte Area </h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScg2uopbLKsHPbG2VGQdtsCkVrYiZJAzEsapNXC1-2l3Ajx9w/viewform\">Register for the Sunday Tutoring Group</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What We Offer</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6>Personalized Tutoring</h6>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We are flexible and adapt to your needs to grow and excel through curriculum. Whether you are in kindergarten or upper elementary school, we are here to help!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6>Dedicated Support</h6>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Through our carefully-planned lessons interactive lessons, and engaged tutors, we help children excel and thrive in school. We offer small group tutoring in Math and English Language Arts (Reading and Writing) for students from K – 5+.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We learn your goals and work hard to help you achieve them. Our highly-competent tutors have their full-on dedicated support for you to reach your goals!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6>Sunday Study Group</h6>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sunday Study Group is a small group format tutoring, help student a better achievement for school study. Hold biweekly on Sunday at Providence Presbyterian Church in Charlotte.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/IMG_1119.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/thumbnail_Image2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/thumbnail_Image.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSezSiK_3921H2mS_JzevJn5CVZxYrWhmYZZnQOfxEG_dACoxg/viewform\">Register for the Sunday Tutoring Group</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-9\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>PO Box 2422,&nbsp;</b><b>Matthews, NC 28106</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>+1 704-839-9583</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>ollietreefoundation@gmail.com</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Copyright © 2024 OllieTree Foundation</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
